<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-29T10:16:28.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:16:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese naval activity has intensified around the Philippines, with multiple Chinese coast guard and navy ships spotted near Scarborough Shoal and Panatag Shoal, and the carrier Liaoning entering the western Pacific alongside 17 other vessels raising alarm in Japan, Taiwan and the Philippines. The Philippine Coast Guard reported fuel deliveries to Filipino fishermen at Scarborough Shoal while monitoring the presence of Chinese vessels. Australian defence officials warned that China’s military buildup is creating pressure in the region. The conflict recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNelRKZ21DWjJBX09xRTJyZnBicWsyLWJTQk1CcmVoVFJYLXBIcWt6LWpwdDRyeGhzbFpNaUFmV0ZhM0NuWmNVRXpKd2s2QnY3bTdwTUFJSFBoUEVUNjlWbThFLXpxN0dkRklMYy1JQVZhWW5abUNtQlZYc21la2htWWVzUWVBMjhTMHc5OF80V3EzLWVPQmFhZnFyOExtWEVfeFhsMnVOYzdfakc1NHdIMjN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPZy1HT2JnM1FCVkVJaXNfX0k3TlRVNEs3Z3QzblktUjVCX3dpOGJhZHBXNzh0WGUwNlJLNVNMTG0zamJuTzZvMHRrZlNqRGtNOWhjTTV0TVJzSWRuVDAwX1RYYjNDbndNdGZnQzM1TE1WVzdPM2tNTFNmNTlCUUMwdS1wdE85WmZRTVlhWkhuWFFQUU5wQVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;inkl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE5QbDN5SnE5dGhvamhFbDVnSENzQURERnhXTHZxS1pjQVNMbjBaMkQtYUdVZGxVSWJxX0JpdDBOcmFES0Qzd2lZWDlnaURpb2dCNjc1bDRlRGtVd01tbGRMZWZNRzB0Ul82NHBOWVFIYVhyWjN5VUR0eQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Diplomatic Insight&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9BcWlIZGoxQXF5TGdDbzlrS3p3MnRNWVFLUV90RlFackhpbklfWko1NzZ5c0tDQ00yeUhMdnBmRkJLeHJRZmh4dllSaGtJVW9lLTViU1Ywcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;헤럴드경제&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dainik Jagran MP CG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.googl